; PCM against FM on the same beat: fm1 keys on every quarter note and pcm1
; starts a sample on the same quarter notes. Graded by gate-score's SYNC row:
; the first DAC sample of each start against the fm1 key-on it goes with.
(def blip (sample :file "blip.wav"))
(fm1 :tempo 120 :oct 4 :len 4 :vel 12 :gate- 4t c c c c c c c c)
(pcm1 blip :oct 4 :len 4 :vel 15 c c c c c c c c)
